{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 2, :comments ["<b>Ephraim</b> — He does not follow the Name but only in His words, for he is a shepherd of wind, like \"the end of words of wind,\" and the witness: \"and a covenant with Assyria they will cut, and oil to Egypt will be brought\" — a gift to the king of Egypt."], :book :hosea, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 12, :notes {0 "The phrase כי הוא רועה רוח echoes Hosea 12:2 (כי רועה רוח הוא); the parenthetical כמו הקץ לדברי רוח is uncertain — possibly a cross-reference, possibly a quotation from another work; read hyper-literally."}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Hosea -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/daat/olam_hatanah/mefaresh.asp?book=15&perek=1&mefaresh=ezra"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:50:57.697087510Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}